{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-03-29 04:00:00', 'title': 'HSBC WORKING WITH IBM TO ACCELERATE QUANTUM COMPUTING READINESS', 'text': 'BANK ENVISIONS APPLICATION OF QUANTUM CAPABILITIES FOR PRIORITIES SUCH AS PRICING AND PORTFOLIO OPTIMISATION, SUSTAINABILITY, RISK AND FRAUD EXPANDS INTERNAL TALENT WITH QUANTUM SPECIALISTS ARMONK, N.Y., MARCH 29, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HSBC AND IBM (NYSE: IBM) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT THEY WILL WORK TOGETHER ON EXPLORING APPLICATIONS FOR QUANTUM COMPUTING IN FINANCIAL SERVICES.'}